LRC14 Boolean-Mobius hierarchy scout (exact fractions)
==============================================================================
Boolean containment/Mobius identity:
  a[A] = meas(A subset missed sectors)
  q[M] = sum_{A superset M} (-1)^(|A|-|M|) a[A]
  Size quotient sum_{|M|=t} q[M] is the THM-534 depth law.
  Full mask quotient has 64 states and is complete for sector atoms.

