==============================================================================
Interpretation
  The full Boolean-Mobius lift is complete for the sector atom law, exactly
  mirroring the pseudoprobability/Mobius view of higher-order Delsarte LPs.
  But individual dihedral-type atoms do not give a clean monotone proof:
  in the k=8 bank, AP is maximal only for depth 0 and the deepest tail
  types (5) and (6).  Most type atoms have many AP beaters.
  This agrees with HYP-2738: the cap-closing certificate must be a signed
  aggregate cut, not a single positive monotone atom.

